{"id":"n21155-1-7","stage":3,"title":"불구하다 · 不顾","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n21155-1-7-1","ko":"매운탕 맛이 참 시원하다.","zh":"辣汤的味道真清爽。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"매운탕","meaning":"鲜辣鱼汤","explanation":"매운탕：鲜辣鱼汤。","readings":[{"term":"매운탕","audio":"/audio/52491633a6b14ea795a5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55709","senseId":"1","lemma":"매운탕","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"매운탕","audio":"/audio/52491633a6b14ea795a5.mp3"}},{"text":"맛이","meaning":"味，味道","explanation":"맛：味，味道；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"맛","audio":"/audio/2bc64d401ca15bdf9987.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66228","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맛이","audio":"/audio/967e9ccf650ca1244186.mp3"}},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确。","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}},{"text":"시원하다.","meaning":"爽口，清爽","explanation":"시원하다：爽口，清爽；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"시원하다","audio":"/audio/a1a23b7fbec5dd69c7b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71281","senseId":"2","lemma":"시원하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시원하다","audio":"/audio/a1a23b7fbec5dd69c7b5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"52491633a6b14ea7","term":"매운탕","zh":"鲜辣鱼汤","audio":"/audio/52491633a6b14ea795a5.mp3","entryId":"55709","definition":"锅中放入鲜鱼和蔬菜，再放入辣椒酱等炖煮而成的辣乎乎的汤。","pronunciation":["매운탕"]},{"id":"2bc64d401ca15bdf","term":"맛","zh":"味，味道","audio":"/audio/2bc64d401ca15bdf9987.mp3","entryId":"66228","definition":"用舌头接触食物等时得到的感觉。","pronunciation":["맏"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"a1a23b7fbec5dd69","ter