":"시원하다","audio":"/audio/a1a23b7fbec5dd69c7b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71281","senseId":"2","lemma":"시원하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시원하다고들","audio":"/audio/8edd0abcb4ebdcc72de4.mp3"}},{"text":"하네.","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하네","audio":"/audio/49707a90866365ec2f6e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"28fc4f685e87f9f4","term":"국물","zh":"汤水，汤汁","audio":"/audio/28fc4f685e87f9f4926f.mp3","entryId":"64512","definition":"在清汤或浓汤等食物里，除去汤料以外剩下的水。","pronunciation":["궁물"]},{"id":"e13d571ed55588ae","term":"뜨겁다","zh":"烫，热","audio":"/audio/e13d571ed55588aea4ab.mp3","entryId":"66027","definition":"某物的温度高。","pronunciation":["뜨겁따"]},{"id":"4d8e523d721336da","term":"불구하다","zh":"不顾，尽管","audio":"/audio/4d8e523d721336da114b.mp3","entryId":"21155","definition":"不理会，不在乎。","pronunciation":["불구하다"]},{"id":"a1a23b7fbec5dd69","term":"시원하다","zh":"爽口，清爽","audio":"/audio/a1a23b7fbec5dd69c7b5.mp3","entryId":"71281","definition":"食物冰凉爽快、正合胃口，或热乎得让人畅快淋漓。","pronunciation":["시원하다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/776ce484a145e4aaae59.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.913,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=21155","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":119,"sequenceScore":3.3897,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["辣汤的味道真清爽。","据说韩国人就算汤是热的，也觉得它很清爽。","妈妈！我饿了！"],"answer":0},{"lineInde